### ============================================================
### 36-SpringSecurity JWT & RBAC API Testing (Port: 8136)
### ============================================================

### 1. Đăng ký tài khoản USER mới
POST http://localhost:8136/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}

### 2. Đăng ký tài khoản ADMIN mới
POST http://localhost:8136/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "ROLE_ADMIN"
}

### 3. Đăng nhập lấy JWT Token (ADMIN)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8136/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Đăng nhập lấy JWT Token (USER)
# @name loginUser
POST http://localhost:8136/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Lấy danh sách sản phẩm (Yêu cầu Token - Bất kỳ Role nào)
GET http://localhost:8136/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Thêm sản phẩm mới (Chỉ dành cho ADMIN - @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')"))
POST http://localhost:8136/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Secured Server Rack",
  "price": 2500.00
}

### 7. Thử dùng USER thêm sản phẩm (Mong đợi: 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8136/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacked Product",
  "price": 1.00
}
